1
00:00:00,719 --> 00:00:02,299
(Sheldon(voice from Howards laptop):)Hello.

2
00:00:03,555 --> 00:00:05,515
(Penny:)Time to do your laundry, huh?

3
00:00:06,225 --> 00:00:07,395
(Sheldon:)Saturday night.

4
00:00:07,559 --> 00:00:09,479
(Sheldon:)Saturday is laundry night.

5
00:00:09,937 --> 00:00:11,317
(Leonard:)I know.

6
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:14,070
Every Saturday at 8:15.

7
00:00:14,233 --> 00:00:16,943
Easy to anticipate.

8
00:00:19,029 --> 00:00:20,529
SHELDON:
What are you implying?

9
00:00:20,697 --> 00:00:23,577
I'm implying
that you're a creature of habit.

10
00:00:23,742 --> 00:00:27,952
And if something were to prevent you from
doing your laundry on Saturday at 8:15...

11
00:00:28,121 --> 00:00:30,371
...you might find it...

12
00:00:30,541 --> 00:00:32,581
...unpleasant.

13
00:00:38,257 --> 00:00:40,757
Knuckle under, my ass.

14
00:00:47,641 --> 00:00:49,221
(Penny:)Oh, no.

15
00:00:49,393 --> 00:00:51,983
(Penny:)Are all the machines taken?

16
00:00:54,022 --> 00:00:55,942
(Penny:)What are you gonna do?

17
00:00:57,025 --> 00:00:58,405
(Sheldon:)No problem.

18
00:00:58,569 --> 00:01:02,279
(Sheldon:)I'll just do my laundry another night.

